                                    <span class="badge bg-warning bg-opacity-25 text-warning border border-warning px-3 py-1 rounded-pill fw-bold" id="orderStatusBadge_1001">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-hourglass-start me-1"></i> Status: Pending
